{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>人氣男團MIRROR成員姜濤於2025年6月曾不慎在西區副食品批發市場對開發生墮海意外，消息震驚全港成為全城熱話。沒想到他毫不介懷，更將經歷化為搞笑素材。近期他與馮德倫合作拍攝廣告，片中大方重提舊事「自我抽水」，展現幽默一面。</p><figure><img alt=\"姜濤孖馮德倫合作拍廣告。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179122649633132544068725.png/i-3LZEv9ZX6zPP4-Wqg0-G7FSXnDhbdtCGtIewhrSHs\"/><figcaption>姜濤孖馮德倫合作拍廣告。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）</figcaption></figure><p>姜濤：純落水唔係我嘅selling point</p><p>廣告片中，馮德倫與身穿救生衣的姜濤在海邊準備拍攝落水場景。馮德倫以導演身份耐心教戲，並安慰姜濤跟隨其後即可。然而姜濤並未立刻就位，反問：「係咪一定要落水㗎呢？純落水嚟講，我諗唔係我嘅selling point。」場面極度搞笑。</p><figure><img alt=\"姜濤自嘲浸過鹹水。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179122676485591040967054.png/6Wn5L1wMuSRTAB8BuPDJ135yEVxe4HuxeU-Kq3lPiqs\"/><figcaption>姜濤自嘲浸過鹹水。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"做好準備動作熱身。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179122673964683264752908.png/UOS2xzSwhduBfdPepqQhIM-87Jip4eN4qGYhT6hmIU8\"/><figcaption>做好準備動作熱身。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）</figcaption></figure><p>姜濤自封「落水KOL」</p><p>面對馮德倫質疑其害怕落水，姜濤隨即發揮自嘲本領：「驚咩啊？落水嚟講，我都算係KOL」。馮德倫當場笑住反駁：「KOL？落得嗰一次……又唔係自己爬返上岸，咁都叫KOL呀？」。姜濤則順勢回應，坦言這次落水前必須先收拾好儀容，笑稱「上次撈我上嚟張相係差啲」，爆笑回應令觀眾忍俊不禁。片中在姜濤落水的一刻，鏡頭特寫海水畫面，水花四濺、效果超級誇張且充滿戲劇感。</p><figure><img alt=\"姜濤自嘲「落水界KOL」。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179122671406026752591302.png/q4Bl9I4alBmXuCUSXQ7na1-FgJ7wd6tAlMWGEJTFhhA\"/><figcaption>姜濤自嘲「落水界KOL」。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"落水前收拾儀容，嫌上次被撈上岸的照片太差。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179122669052891136698312.png/0tzZBxrWA6Ox3VeS84UROUQa_0hCK8HPbtniQm7Z4kI\"/><figcaption>落水前收拾儀容，嫌上次被撈上岸的照片太差。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"水花超誇張。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260922/1179122666641035264937518.png/hxyX_RFS-CyYs8VqYhMd8GtihijfjmjrFVdNWRVXTVk\"/><figcaption>水花超誇張。（YouTube@HSBC Hong Kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250625/1014633367029026816379654.jpeg/nXYRpQICH_p6N5-Q3oPdpks5XTt4hxVJwQBeZ8EAXmc\"/><figcaption>姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250625/1014633361404203008274630.jpeg/1LRJGGF0z7veMKaWjXG48QeHTd4_-Vvv0KB7fNCge3w\"/><figcaption>姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250625/1014633364868829184937251.jpeg/idJayWaILZ83bNzie4BcwdswTM7uYFPvp-I8PafiPD0\"/><figcaption>姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250625/1014633359646658560365278.jpeg/Cnh5PL6FDRKIPHcqzhU1SLX9AjBRcQXsJ8T1OSfE9Tk\"/><figcaption>姜濤墮海獲救經過。（《東張西望》截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T14:39:40.747068+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":739,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}